  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CODE &#x2013; Improved capacities to counter Disinformation in Eastern Partnership. IMS. 2023-2025.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Project is to improve the resilience of vulnerable population groups in the Eastern Partnerships (EaP) region to obtain fact-based information and enhance critical thinking. The project will contribute to increased capacity of key institutions (media houses, organisations, and governments)  to effectively enhance the resilience of vulnerable populations to disinformation. Moreover, the environment (policy and digital infrastructure) will be more enabling for responsible, inclusive and fact-based journalism.</narrative>
  </description>
